# HP39gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# Start the lazy HPGCC/APLET transfer early, then wait for the evidence-based
# worst-case Kermit envelope before entering the downloaded aplet.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk
13300 tap enter
31000 capture remote-aplet
32500 tap enter
34000 capture lazy-fetch

# Monitor the result word throughout transfer and Gallery execution. The first
# late ENTER advances the completed lazy install to the HPGCC aplet launch
# screen; the captured failure from the previous run proved that this screen
# then requires one more ENTER to enter HPC1. If a faster stock path has already
# entered Gallery, that second ENTER is only the harmless sample/text toggle.
34500 monitor 450000
410000 tap enter
416000 tap enter
428000 capture native-mini
431000 tap down
434000 capture native-main
437000 tap right
440000 capture generated-control
443000 tap on
